	)
	(text "Where the values come from (hidden fields Status / Note on every part say more):\n  K  known (drawing / owners' notes): V1 V2\n  P  read from board photographs: R1 R8 Q7 R27 R2 R5 R3 R4 R6 C4 R7 C5 C6 R9 Q6 R19 R10 Q5 R12 R13 R14 R25\n  E  estimate: R20 R21 R22 R23 RSW C1 C3 R11 C8 D10 C7\n\nQ7 / Q6 are U310 metal-can JFETs (model: low-pinch-off corner of the data sheet, see superit.lib).\nR3 and R8 are wire links on the photographed board (1 mOhm here so the netlist keeps them).\nR13 / R14: pot wiper position is Sim.Params pos (1 = full level, 0 = off).\nS1 and J1 / J2 are excluded from simulation; RSW1 stands in for the selected S1A load.\nV1: both halves in parallel (pins 1,2,3 and 6,7,8).  V2: this channel uses one half,\nthe other channel the other half (the stock ECC83 symbol letters the 1-2-3 half 'B')."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "07cec3ad-9375-59b6-aa7e-2abb6ac871e0")
	)
